	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["53336232501835EE"]
			description: [
				"The cleanroom works, so welcome to HV. Crude oil stops being something you burn and turns into chemistry, and stainless steel goes into everything."
				"The way out is up: a rocket to the Moon."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_machine_hull"
			id: "3610F788A08B9FD3"
			rewards: [{ id: "097536B58AB1C2EC", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "652DBE317E40AFE7", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "HV Factory"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3610F788A08B9FD3"]
			description: [
				"Another tier, another round of motors, pumps and arms, mostly in stainless steel this time. You'll be making these for the rest of the age, so an assembler that does nothing else isn't a bad idea."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_electric_motor"
			id: "5B595A919C80BFC0"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B58F6733D9F1DB6", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1259BDC6AE103E3A", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_motor", type: "item" }
				{ id: "75481D84726D613B", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_piston", type: "item" }
				{ id: "23DA5CC1B81AD05C", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_pump", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5BC3088D093E5BCF", item: "gtceu:hv_robot_arm", type: "item" }
				{ id: "61D202ED6D17FF04", item: "gtceu:hv_conveyor_module", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "HV Components"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: [
				"The drill family grows again: one HV hatch now runs more bores at once. It knows every vein the smaller drills do, Earth and End alike, and your pickaxe stays retired."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_vein_drill"
			id: "721FA9268C278B3F"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "291D4CDF7933776F", type: "xp", xp: 60 }
				{ count: 16, id: "3270F51E23F41A5D", item: "minecraft:torch", type: "item" }
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "3FA479D4D0FB6DE4", item: "gtceu:hv_vein_drill", type: "item" }]
			title: "HV Vein Drill"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["721FA9268C278B3F"]
			description: [
				"The HV drill's own bit, in stainless steel. If you run out, the old vanadium steel bit still fits, so the drill never has to sit idle."
			]
			icon: "grindless:stainless_steel_drill_bit"
			id: "2CD2C8EF5A408796"
			rewards: [{ id: "396C938D1616ED8E", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "4222DE23EA3992E8", item: "grindless:stainless_steel_drill_bit", type: "item" }]
			title: "Stainless Steel Drill Bit"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: [
				"The greenhouse's HV size: same crops, more bores per run. HV doesn't need more wood than MV did, because the new carbon comes up out of the ground as crude oil."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_greenhouse"
			id: "3C06724477E3E0BB"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "35502C2CA21A059D", type: "xp", xp: 55 }
				{ count: 4, id: "7689DD0946DD2CEE", item: "minecraft:wheat_seeds", type: "item" }
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "5DB8D7813E63F2DC", item: "gtceu:hv_greenhouse", type: "item" }]
			title: "HV Greenhouse"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: [
				"The &6Refinery&r takes crude oil and hydrogen and hands back every fraction in one pass, sulfur already removed. GregTech alone would want a distillery pass per fraction and a reactor to clean each one."
				"A programmed circuit picks the job: refining, hydrocracking or steam cracking."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:refinery"
			id: "5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "012A2C94D6BE9D69", type: "xp", xp: 90 }
				{ count: 16, id: "74C549950BA61877", item: "minecraft:torch", type: "item" }
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "659FBFC6A4539F6D", item: "gtceu:refinery", type: "item" }]
			title: "Refinery"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"]
			description: [
				"The &6Syngas Plant&r blasts powdered coal or heavy fuel with steam and gives back carbon monoxide and hydrogen, each in its own hatch. That's the easy hydrogen for the ammonia in rocket fuel."
				"The carbon monoxide is toxic, so shift it or turn it into methanol."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:syngas_plant"
			id: "4C18E0B7D5A92F61"
			rewards: [{ id: "47E2104B9F6D3A58", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "0E5A7C2D98B14F36", item: "gtceu:syngas_plant", type: "item" }]
			title: "Syngas Plant"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4C18E0B7D5A92F61"]
			description: [
				"On circuit 4 the plant runs carbon monoxide and steam over the &6Shift Catalyst&r, and the poison comes out as carbon dioxide and more hydrogen. Send it to the refinery."
				"The catalyst is mixed from magnetite and chromium dust, and it wears out slowly."
			]
			icon: "grindless:shift_catalyst"
			id: "7B52A3F9E0C84D16"
			rewards: [{ id: "19B8F5D3A60E7C42", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1D4F16B0A2E73C85", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Water-Gas Shift"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"]
			description: [
				"The refinery eats a &6Hydrotreating Catalyst&r every so often, so keep spares in its input bus. Cobalt comes from the nickel vein and molybdenum from the Nether, and the syngas plant's ash can stand in for the silica."
			]
			icon: "grindless:hydrotreating_catalyst"
			id: "64F01001238ACD74"
			rewards: [{ id: "7BB92FDB97461071", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "700AC5219F2F1ADB", item: "grindless:hydrotreating_catalyst", type: "item" }]
			title: "Hydrotreating Catalyst"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64F01001238ACD74"]
			description: [
				"Put circuit 3 in the refinery, give it steam, and naphtha comes back as ethylene, propene, butadiene and benzene. Most of HV's plastics start there."
				"Circuit 2 cracks with hydrogen instead, which is handy for whatever fraction keeps piling up."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:refinery"
			id: "1051C4B8835DB4A3"
			rewards: [{ id: "40F96569A80405B1", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5104D985778131A0", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Cracking and Olefins"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64F01001238ACD74"]
			description: [
				"GregTech never reforms naphtha, so the &6Catalytic Reformer&r does: benzene, toluene, and hydrogen to send straight back to the refinery."
				"It's optional. Without it the electrolyzer covers the hydrogen, with less to spare."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:reformer"
			id: "52781D6F5A69C4BE"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "46D2EE333DEFD840", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "3D77A53BF29A83F5", item: "gtceu:reformer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Catalytic Reformer"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["52781D6F5A69C4BE"]
			description: [
				"Platinum on silica, and the platinum comes from the End's sheldonite vein. That End sample in your drill finally earns its keep."
			]
			icon: "grindless:reforming_catalyst"
			id: "045FA73ADE3D0624"
			rewards: [{ id: "5669400C0C30D05F", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "0CAB2A5FCAE4C6DC", item: "grindless:reforming_catalyst", type: "item" }]
			title: "Reforming Catalyst"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1051C4B8835DB4A3"]
			description: [
				"&6PTFE&r is the plastic nothing eats, which is why the large chemical reactor is lined with it. The road runs through chloroform and TFE."
				"Methane comes from distilling refinery gas, and the fluorine from topaz, lepidolite or bastnasite."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:inert_machine_casing"
			id: "720331A06D7F2344"
			rewards: [{ id: "2BA86A8E9940CABD", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 8L, id: "2B26A5F014E45D2A", item: "gtceu:inert_machine_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "PTFE"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["720331A06D7F2344"]
			description: [
				"With PTFE walls, the &6Large Chemical Reactor&r can finally be built. Its big job in HV is gasoline, and the methanol and acetone piling up since MV go straight into it."
				"Gasoline is also a far better fuel than creosote."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:large_chemical_reactor"
			id: "35719B747A75F7B6"
			rewards: [{ id: "3EB45CE14A466656", type: "xp", xp: 55 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1E56A8818DE368EE", item: "gtceu:large_chemical_reactor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gasoline"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1051C4B8835DB4A3"]
			description: [
				"The &6Composite Autoclave&r cures fiber in epoxy under nitrogen pressure, which no single machine can do."
				"Build it as a vessel lying on two saddles with the door facing you, and leave the inside empty: everything comes in through the hatches."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:composite_autoclave"
			id: "3B7E2C9A41D06F85"
			rewards: [{ id: "2A3D5F1E07C4B926", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			shape: "gear"
